<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>KV_002_MANDALA | KARV</title>
  <meta name="description" content="KV_002_MANDALA, poltrona autoral KARV com arte aplicada ao mobiliário para ambientes com identidade." />
  <meta property="og:title" content="KV_002_MANDALA | KARV" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Quando a arte inspira, o ambiente se transforma." />
  <meta property="og:image" content="assets/hero.jpg" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#11100d" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --black: #11100d;
      --black-soft: #191713;
      --cream: #f4efe6;
      --cream-2: #ebe3d6;
      --sand: #c18a45;
      --sand-dark: #9d6c34;
      --greige: #7b6d5e;
      --text: #221e18;
      --muted: #6f6458;
      --line: rgba(34,30,24,.14);
      --white: #fffaf2;
      --max: 1180px;
      --shadow-soft: 0 18px 42px rgba(34, 30, 24, .18);
      --shadow-strong: 0 28px 70px rgba(34, 30, 24, .26);
      --bevel-light: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.42);
      --bevel-dark: inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(34,30,24,.16);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    img {
      max-width: 100%;
      display: block;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    .serif {
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 44px;
      padding: 0 24px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .03em;
      transition: transform .18s ease, opacity .18s ease, background .18s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      white-space: nowrap;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); opacity: .92; }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d09a53, #a97235);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,.16);
      border-color: rgba(208,154,83,.72);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn-outline {
      border-color: rgba(208,154,83,.72);
      color: var(--sand);
      background: transparent;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 48px 24px;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(var(--max), 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .site-header {
      position: absolute;
      z-index: 20;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 24px 28px;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .nav {
      width: min(1240px, 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .logo {
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: 28px;
      letter-spacing: .18em;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 34px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 650;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .045em;
      opacity: .92;
    }

    .menu-icon {
      display: none;
      width: 28px;
      height: 20px;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .menu-icon span {
      display: block;
      height: 2px;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 690px;
      color: #fff;
      display: grid;
      align-items: stretch;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--black);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 58px rgba(34,30,24,.22);
    }

    .hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(12,11,9,.98) 0%, rgba(12,11,9,.78) 32%, rgba(12,11,9,.16) 66%, rgba(12,11,9,.25) 100%),
        linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(12,11,9,.1), rgba(12,11,9,.25));
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .hero-img {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
      filter: saturate(.93) contrast(1.04);
      transition: transform .35s ease, filter .35s ease;
      cursor: zoom-in;
    }

    .hero:hover .hero-img {
      transform: scale(1.018);
      filter: saturate(1) contrast(1.05);
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
      width: min(1240px, 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 120px 28px 58px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      max-width: 430px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(43px, 5.2vw, 72px);
      line-height: .93;
      margin: 0 0 24px;
    }

    .accent { color: var(--sand); }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 17px;
      color: rgba(255,250,242,.86);
      max-width: 420px;
      margin: 0 0 30px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .product {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 25%, rgba(255,255,255,.78), transparent 34%),
        linear-gradient(120deg, #f7f1e8, #ebe1d3);
      padding: 58px 24px 52px;
    }

    .product-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.05fr;
      gap: 56px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .product-image {
      position: relative;
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255,250,242,.82), rgba(222,210,194,.44));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.66);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-strong), var(--bevel-light), var(--bevel-dark);
    }

    .product-image::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 1px;
      border-radius: 17px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(34,30,24,.08);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .product-image img {
      width: 100%;
      max-height: 440px;
      object-fit: contain;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 24px 30px rgba(34,30,24,.22));
      transition: transform .3s ease, filter .3s ease;
      cursor: zoom-in;
    }

    .product-image:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 34px 78px rgba(34, 30, 24, .28), var(--bevel-light), var(--bevel-dark);
      transition: transform .3s ease, box-shadow .3s ease;
    }

    .product-image:hover img {
      transform: scale(1.02);
      filter: drop-shadow(0 28px 36px rgba(34,30,24,.26));
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--sand-dark);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .product h2,
    .details h2,
    .applications h2,
    .inspiration h2,
    .cta h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(32px, 3.4vw, 48px);
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .product p,
    .applications p,
    .inspiration p,
    .cta p {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 18px 0 0;
      max-width: 520px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      margin-top: 34px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .feature {
      padding: 20px 16px 0;
      text-align: center;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
      position: relative;
    }

    .feature:last-child { border-right: 0; }

    .icon {
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto 9px;
      font-size: 30px;
      line-height: 1;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    }

    .feature strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .details {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #161410, #0f0e0c);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 58px 24px;
    }

    .details-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .72fr 1.28fr;
      gap: 42px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .details p {
      color: rgba(255,250,242,.72);
      margin: 16px 0 0;
      max-width: 340px;
    }

    .detail-cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .detail-card img {
      height: 150px;
      width: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 38px rgba(0,0,0,.38), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.24);
      outline: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.22);
      outline-offset: -3px;
      transition: transform .28s ease, box-shadow .28s ease, filter .28s ease;
      cursor: zoom-in;
    }

    .detail-card {
      padding: 8px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255,255,255,.09), rgba(255,255,255,.02));
      box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.12), 0 18px 42px rgba(0,0,0,.20);
      transition: transform .28s ease, box-shadow .28s ease;
    }

    .detail-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.12), 0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,.28);
    }

    .detail-card:hover img {
      transform: scale(1.03);
      box-shadow: 0 22px 44px rgba(0,0,0,.42), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.24);
      filter: saturate(1.02);
    }

    .detail-card span {
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      color: rgba(255,250,242,.72);
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .applications {
      background: var(--cream);
      padding: 50px 24px 46px;
    }

    .apps-header {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .apps-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .app-card {
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255,250,242,.92), rgba(226,215,200,.54));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.70);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft), var(--bevel-light), var(--bevel-dark);
      transition: transform .28s ease, box-shadow .28s ease;
    }

    .app-card img {
      height: 136px;
      width: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(34,30,24,.08);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(34,30,24,.18);
      transition: transform .28s ease, box-shadow .28s ease, filter .28s ease;
      cursor: zoom-in;
    }

    .app-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 52px rgba(34,30,24,.22), var(--bevel-light), var(--bevel-dark);
    }

    .app-card:hover img {
      transform: scale(1.03);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 34px rgba(34,30,24,.22);
      filter: saturate(1.02);
    }

    .app-card strong {
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .inspiration {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 310px;
      color: #fff;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--black);
      box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.12), inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.45);
    }

    .inspiration img {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center;
      filter: saturate(.95);
    }

    .inspiration::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 1;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(13,12,10,.9), rgba(13,12,10,.55) 34%, rgba(13,12,10,.06) 70%);
    }

    .inspiration .container {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      padding: 54px 24px;
    }

    .inspiration p {
      color: rgba(255,250,242,.78);
      max-width: 360px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .cta {
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #f6efe4, #e8ded1);
      padding: 58px 24px;
    }

    .cta-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .92fr 1.3fr auto;
      gap: 38px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .cta .features {
      margin: 0;
      border-top: 0;
    }

    .cta .feature {
      padding-top: 0;
    }

    .footer {
      background: var(--black);
      color: rgba(255,250,242,.76);
      padding: 28px 24px;
    }

    .footer-grid {
      width: min(var(--max), 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 160px 1fr 130px;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .footer .logo {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 25px;
    }

    .footer p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .social {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .btn:focus-visible,
    .zoomable:focus-visible,
    .zoom-modal-close:focus-visible,
    .floating-whatsapp:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--sand);
      outline-offset: 4px;
    }

    .floating-whatsapp {
      position: fixed;
      right: 18px;
      bottom: 18px;
      z-index: 1500;
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      padding: 0 18px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d09a53, #a97235);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .03em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(34,30,24,.32), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.22);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.24);
    }

    .floating-whatsapp span {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-left: 8px;
    }

    .zoom-modal {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 2000;
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px;
      background: rgba(10, 9, 8, .88);
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    }

    .zoom-modal.open {
      display: flex;
    }

    .zoom-modal-backdrop {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
    }

    .zoom-modal-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: 96vw;
      max-height: 92vh;
      overflow: auto;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255,250,242,.96), rgba(228,216,199,.92));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.72);
      box-shadow: 0 32px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.48), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.48), inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(34,30,24,.12);
    }

    .zoom-modal img {
      display: block;
      width: auto;
      height: auto;
      max-width: none;
      max-height: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 42px rgba(34,30,24,.24);
    }

    .zoom-modal-close {
      position: absolute;
      right: 10px;
      top: 10px;
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(34,30,24,.12);
      background: rgba(255,250,242,.92);
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(34,30,24,.16);
    }

    .zoom-modal-caption {
      margin-top: 12px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 13px;
      text-align: center;
    }

@media (max-width: 920px) {
      .site-header {
        position: absolute;
        padding: 18px 18px;
      }

      .nav {
        grid-template-columns: 38px 1fr auto;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .menu-icon { display: flex; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }

      .logo {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .site-header .btn {
        min-height: 36px;
        padding: 0 12px;
        font-size: 10px;
        max-width: 128px;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
      }

      .floating-whatsapp {
        display: inline-flex;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 660px;
      }

      .hero::before {
        background:
          linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(12,11,9,.68), rgba(12,11,9,.88) 44%, rgba(12,11,9,.98)),
          linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(12,11,9,.86), rgba(12,11,9,.32));
      }

      .hero-img {
        object-position: center top;
      }

      .hero-content {
        padding: 92px 22px 38px;
        align-items: flex-end;
      }

      .hero-copy {
        max-width: 100%;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 47px;
        max-width: 360px;
      }

      .hero p {
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        flex-direction: column;
        max-width: 300px;
      }

      .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .product {
        padding: 40px 22px;
      }

      .product-grid,
      .details-grid,
      .cta-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 32px;
      }

      .product-image img {
        max-height: 320px;
      }

      .features {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 0;
      }

      .feature {
        border-right: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding: 22px 12px;
      }

      .feature:nth-child(odd) { border-right: 1px solid var(--line); }

      .details {
        padding: 38px 22px;
      }

      .detail-cards {
        display: flex;
        overflow-x: auto;
        scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
        padding-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .detail-card {
        min-width: 84%;
        scroll-snap-align: start;
      }

      .apps-grid {
        display: flex;
        overflow-x: auto;
        gap: 16px;
        padding-bottom: 10px;
        scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      }

      .app-card {
        min-width: 84%;
        scroll-snap-align: start;
      }

      .app-card img {
        height: 145px;
      }

      .inspiration {
        min-height: 430px;
      }

      .inspiration::before {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(13,12,10,.86), rgba(13,12,10,.24) 62%, rgba(13,12,10,.88));
      }

      .inspiration .container {
        padding: 42px 22px;
      }

      .cta {
        padding: 38px 22px;
      }

      .cta .features {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      .footer-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .footer .logo { text-align: center; }
      .social { justify-content: center; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 40px;
      }

      .product h2,
      .details h2,
      .applications h2,
      .inspiration h2,
      .cta h2 {
        font-size: 32px;
      }

      .details p {
        max-width: 100%;
      }

      .section {
        padding-left: 18px;
        padding-right: 18px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <nav class="nav" aria-label="Navegação principal">
      <div class="menu-icon" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      <a class="logo" href="#">KARV</a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#produto">Produto</a>
        <a href="#detalhes">Acabamentos</a>
        <a href="#aplicacoes">Aplicações</a>
        <a href="#inspiracao">Inspiração</a>
        <a href="#contato">Contato</a>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://wa.me/55011945197063?text=Olá,%20quero%20solicitar%20orçamento%20da%20KV_002_MANDALA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Solicitar orçamento da KV_002_MANDALA</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <img class="hero-img zoomable" tabindex="0" src="assets/hero.jpg" alt="Poltrona KV_002_MANDALA em estúdio criativo com artista trabalhando" />
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1 class="serif">Quando a arte inspira, o ambiente <span class="accent">se transforma.</span></h1>
          <p>A KV_002_MANDALA une conforto, presença visual e expressão artística em uma peça criada para ambientes com identidade.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://wa.me/55011945197063?text=Olá,%20quero%20solicitar%20orçamento%20da%20KV_002_MANDALA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Solicitar orçamento da KV_002_MANDALA</a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#produto">Explorar a peça</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="produto" class="product">
      <div class="container product-grid">
        <div class="product-image">
          <img class="zoomable" loading="lazy" decoding="async" tabindex="0" src="assets/produto-principal.jpg" alt="Poltrona KV_002_MANDALA com revestimento artístico mandala" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">KV_002_MANDALA</div>
          <h2 class="serif">Uma poltrona criada para gerar presença.</h2>
          <p>Formas acolhedoras, proporções equilibradas e revestimento artístico tornam esta peça o centro das atenções em qualquer ambiente.</p>

